          "file": "voices/us/idle-quip-02.mp3",
          "text": "I'd trade my rifle for a hot cup of coffee. Almost.",
          "delivery": "idle"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleQuip",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-quip-03.mp3",
          "text": "If anybody sees my clean socks, tell 'em I miss 'em.",
          "delivery": "idle"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleQuip",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-quip-04.mp3",
          "text": "Next fellow who says this is a short walk gets my pack.",
          "delivery": "idle"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleQuip",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-quip-05.mp3",
          "text": "I swear this helmet gets heavier every mile.",
          "delivery": "idle"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleStory",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-story-01.mp3",
          "text": "Back home my brother borrowed my good boots for one dance. Came home barefoot and swore a dog stole 'em. That dog must've known his size.",
          "delivery": "story"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleStory",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-story-02.mp3",
          "text": "My old man said the Army would make a man outta me. First week I spent two hours peeling potatoes. Guess manhood comes with a paring knife.",
          "delivery": "story"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleStory",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-story-03.mp3",
          "text": "Cook back at camp swore that stew was beef. I asked what part of the cow rattles when you stir it. He didn't think that was funny.",
          "delivery": "story"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleStory",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-story-04.mp3",
          "text": "Buddy of mine once saluted a scarecrow at dawn. In his defense, the scarecrow had better posture than our lieutenant.",
          "delivery": "story"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleStory",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-story-05.mp3",
          "text": "I wrote my girl I'd come home with medals. She wrote back she'd settle for me coming home with all my teeth. Fair bargain, I figure.",
          "delivery": "story"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleLaugh",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-laugh-01.mp3",
          "text": "Ha! Ha ha!",
          "delivery": "laugh"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleLaugh",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-laugh-02.mp3",
          "text": "Heh heh... that's awful.",
          "delivery": "laugh"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleLaugh",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-laugh-03.mp3",
          "text": "Ha! You're full of it!",
          "delivery": "laugh"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleLaugh",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-laugh-04.mp3",
          "text": "Oh, that's good. Ha ha!",
          "delivery": "laugh"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleLaugh",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-laugh-05.mp3",
          "text": "Heh! Don't let the lieutenant hear that one.",
          "delivery": "laugh"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleGroan",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-groan-01.mp3",
          "text": "Oh, come on. You've told that one three times.",
          "delivery": "idle"
        },
        {
          "event": "idleGroan",
          "file": "voices/us/idle-groan-02.mp3",
          "text": "That's terrible. Tell it again.",
          "delivery": "idle"
        }
      ]
    },
